            Stacking bad subs dilutes your Signal-to-Noise Ratio (SNR) and turns crisp stars into mush. Here is how to stop wasting 45 minutes manual-blinking 400 heavy RAW files and pinpoint cloud dips and ruined frames in seconds using 2D scatter plots.
          </p>
